{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0282_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0282_1000_001har", "source_sha256": "f4f7d4d72efb415db7d5c3b2582ee32ecb4d12388a486f3819e1812822ee2714", "ja": "わぁ！　ここが水上運動会の会場ですか？\nとっても広いですね、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "哇！这里就是水上运动会的会场吗？\n真是宽敞呢，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0282_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0282_1001_p", "source_sha256": "909f03beef1cffbd236534e186680da6f07ea487ab453515bcac5f365cae8910", "ja": "そうだな。この後水着に着替えて、競技に参加して\nもらうけど……足元滑りやすいから、気を付けてな。", "zh": "是啊。接下来要换上泳衣参加比赛……不过这里地面很滑，要小心啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0282_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0282_1002_001har", "source_sha256": "78d4cfc0960be01c935cd946cef4bb93dc48222f2b9a918583f6fc9e6677dd4a", "ja": "えへへ、大丈夫ですよ。プールでの撮影だって\nたくさんしてきてますし、もう慣れてます♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，没关系的。我也拍过很多泳池取景的照片，已经习惯了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0282_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0282_1003_001har", "source_sha256": "2f39139dac44c15fdab8759dbbcaa4dd1bb404bbabd03d37f9b9346789301184", "ja": "それに今日は、劇場のみんなも出るし、\n恥ずかしいところは見せられませんから。", "zh": "而且今天剧场的大家也都会参加，不能让大家看到我丢脸的样子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0282_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0282_1004_001har", "source_sha256": "8c9eb0c171ad56858e44689d0c3bd05770ae14d0c30f64be895b69d8e6b86fbf", "ja": "転ぶどころか、みんなのお手本になれるような……\nかっこいいところを見せたいと思ってますっ！", "zh": "别说摔倒了，我还想展现出能成为大家榜样的……帅气一面！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0282_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0282_1005_p", "source_sha256": "8bfecc19cf3e6b2b7a8468af40a8be9e1f09307e8ba14f34fe09ab8ab4d2933d", "ja": "おおっ、すごい自信だな。よーし、その調子で、\nよろしく頼むぞ、春香！", "zh": "哦哦，真有自信啊。好，就保持这个劲头，拜托你了，春香！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0282_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0282_1006_001har", "source_sha256": "101e78f41b403ee73c9d2d9d2e3c5d34d9862a1a7e07d2f9e46d618b2c72264d", "ja": "はい、それじゃ早速水着に着替えてきますね。\n失礼します……って、きゃあああ～～～！？", "zh": "好的，那我这就去换泳装。\n失陪了……呀啊啊啊～～～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0282_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0282_1007_p", "source_sha256": "44dcc943409cb6cf6152180738eab92cb5ae26ec96f940ac38176f388b800b1f", "ja": "春香！？　大丈夫かっ！？\nああ……さっきの自信は一体……。", "zh": "春香！？　你没事吧！？\n哎……刚才那股自信劲儿去哪了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
